versionEdits.description:
Tracks the version history of an object, which is only active if version history tracking is enabled. This field is
crucial for accessing previous versions of an object and is entirely managed by the system.

@see Ann.Db#versionHistory

title:
Demo asset criticality level classification for UI testing.

This type defines the criticality levels used to categorize demo assets
in the Asset Performance UI library. Levels determine maintenance priority
and monitoring requirements.


// Create critical level
UiApDemoAssetLevel.make({
  name: "Critical"
}).create()

// Create normal level
UiApDemoAssetLevel.make({
  name: "Normal"
}).create()
